+/*
+ * K60 bring-up breadcrumbs (complements K60_MARK in osfmk/arm64/start.s).
+ *
+ * start.s maps the 2 MiB Device block holding this page into the V=P bootstrap
+ * tables and writes slots 0..3 before entering here.  Slots 4..6 continue in C
